# Card generation & print (do not regress)

Reference: `docs/print-pipeline.md`.

## Deck uniformity

- **One format per deck**: `DECK_CARD_ASPECT_RATIO` (3:4) for every card, trumps and Excuse included. Never reintroduce per-card formats: backs must be indistinguishable.
- **One colour theme per deck**: `settings.colorTheme` → `getCardTheme()`. It feeds every prompt (scene, character, back) AND every rendered colour. Don't hard-code colours in prompts or renderer.
- **One layout**: `getCardLayout()` is shared by faces and back (same contour, same frame language). No per-role chrome (no special gold frame for kings/trumps).
- **One back**: `renderCardBackImage()` → `settings.cardBackImageUrl`, reused for every card in play and print.

## Indices

Drawn from font outlines (`drawRank`): same cap height on all cards, bbox-centred, two-digit ranks tightened/condensed rather than shrunk. Never use SVG `<text>` (Sharp can't rasterize it reliably).

## Foil / dorure

Abandoned. Do not add foil masks, gold extraction, or "paint polished gold for hot-foil" prompt text.

## Print specs

`shared/utils/printSpec.ts`: 300 DPI, 3 mm bleed, trim 63.5 × 88.9 mm. Do not change without updating `README.md` and `docs/print-pipeline.md`.

ZIP: `print/faces/{cardCode}.png`, `print/back/card-back.png`, `print/print-spec.json`.
